# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deliberately an ALLOW-everything / deny-a-little list.
#
# The predecessor repo did the opposite: it ignored EVERY top-level folder with
# `/*/` and then hand-wrote ~60 `!` exceptions. The result was that `Avatars/`
# (183 MB of identity anchors) and `sieve/` (the rubrics + golden experiments
# backing every claim in CLAUDE.md) sat untracked for weeks — un-ignored on
# paper, never actually committed, one `git clean` from gone.
#
# So: do NOT add blanket folder ignores here. Name what you exclude.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Secrets
.env
.env.local

# Dependencies (restore with `npm install`)
node_modules/

# Generated output — regenerable, and this is what bloated the old repo to 3.5 GB
generations/

# Machine noise
.DS_Store
*.log
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Scratch / intermediate artifacts
*.bak
*.pre-fix
*.b64
veo_operation.txt
